  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC funding for Programmes and Awards at MRC Uganda Unit - Science is delivered through six programmes feeding into each theme, including HIV Epidemiology and Intervention, Cancer Epidemiology, Social Aspects of Health Across the Life-Course, Pathogen Genomics Phenotype and Immunity, Immunomodulation and Vaccines, and NCD Phenotyping.</narrative>
  </description>
